
uplink-psibreaker-name = psi-breaker
uplink-psibreaker-desc = A sleek pistol with an engraved marble grip. Capable of launching custom 5u syringe bullets. Legends tell of a school of monks that used these to hunt down psychic threats. Yeah right.

uplink-trinity-name = trinity
uplink-trinity-desc = There are some deeds that a humble servant's hands cannot achieve alone. Like ending someone's life at range in a 3 round burst. Comes pre-loaded with .45 holy ammo.

uplink-sailors-greens-name= Sailor's Greens
uplink-sailors-greens-desc= A can of miraculous vegetables which allow you to beat down your foes with your fists as well as resist stuns, knockdowns, and moderate healing to boot. Also causes hallucinations of jaunty music.
